A Chemically Safe Way to Produce Insect Biomass
for Possible Application in Feed and Food Production
Cristina Truzzi 1, * , Anna Annibaldi 1, * , Federico Girolametti 1 , Leonardo Giovannini 1 ,
Paola Riolo 2 , Sara Ruschioni 2 , Ike Olivotto 1 and Silvia Illuminati 1
